+    // presence forces packing as BGRA. Whether the list has any only depends on
+    // its contents, and the cache is only reused when those did not change, so
+    // consulting the cached value here is enough to decide on a cache hit. With
+    // a split the color part never reaches this layer, so it never has to know.
+    int format = (preferred_osd_format == SUBBITMAP_BGRA ||
+                  (!split && p->mono->cached_has_color)) ?
